# Feature Layout

```
lib/
  main.dart          Firebase init, then ProviderScope + App
  app/               MaterialApp, go_router, theme, app-wide widgets
  core/config/       AppConfig from config/app_config.json
  features/<name>/
    data/            repositories, gateways, failures
    application/     Riverpod providers
    presentation/    screens, widgets/, validators
test/                mirrors lib/ (test/features/auth/data/...)
test/helpers/        shared mocks
```

- New features go in `lib/features/<feature>/{data,application,presentation}`.
  Skip an empty layer.
- `data` never imports `presentation` or Flutter widgets. UI never imports
  Firebase, Google, or Apple SDK types; it talks to a repository and a
  feature failure type (see `AuthRepository` / `AuthFailure`).
- Route paths live on `AppRoutes`. Do not scatter string literals.
- Import app code with `package:mfb_think_tank/...`. Widgets come from
  `package:material_ui/material_ui.dart`.
- Do not edit `lib/firebase_options.dart`; `scripts/configure_firebase.sh`
  generates it. Never commit `android/key.properties` or `*.jks`.
